      0 ➡️ 🖍🆕turns
      🔁 turns ◀️ 8 🍇
        ↪️ 🤜c ⭕ 1🤛 🙌 1 🍇
          0xEDB88320 ❌ 🤜c 👉 1🤛 ➡️ 🖍c
        🍉
        🙅↪️ 👍 🍇
          c 👉 1 ➡️ 🖍c
        🍉
        turns ➕ 1 ➡️ 🖍turns
